e=\"Mage Armor\">Mage Armor</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mage_Armor\" title=\"Mage Armor\">Mage Armor</a></b><br /><b>Caster level:</b> 1<br /><b>Charges: </b>1 (1/day)</span></span> <b>—</b> 1 Charges&#32;(Recharged/Day:1)</li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\">Concentration +1</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\">Concentration +1</a>:</b> Passive: +1 <a href=\"/page/Competence_bonus\" title=\"Competence bonus\">Competence bonus</a> to the <a href=\"/page/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\">Concentration</a> skill.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Starter\" title=\"Starter\">Starter</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Starter\" title=\"Starter\">Starter</a>:</b> Starter equipment cannot be traded, sold or crafted.<br /><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: #FF0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: inherit;\"><i>This item cannot be fed to <a href=\"/page/Sentient_Weapon\" title=\"Sentient Weapon\">sentient jewels</a>.</i></span></span></span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD;\" rowspan=\"5\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Disciple%27s_Robe.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Disciple%27s_Robe.png/420px-Disciple%27s_Robe.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"433\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Disciple%27s_Robe.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><i>This simple outfit has been handed down from master to disciple for generations. It is said to increase your inner calm and focus.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n<p>Given to all new non-<a href=\"/page/Warforged\" title=\"Warforged\">Warforged</a> <a href=\"/page/Monk\" title=\"Monk\">Monks</a>, either during (or upon skipping) The Grotto or <a href=\"/page/The_Voyage\" title=\"The Voyage\">The Voyage</a>.\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p>\n<ul><li><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: #FF0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: inherit;\"><i>This item cannot be fed to <a href=\"/page/Sentient_Weapon\" title=\"Sentient Weapon\">sentient jewels</a>.</i></span></span></li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit 